      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay sounds good. one more thing, what is the security process actually like? is it pretty intense or is it just a standard check? just wondering if i'll be stuck in weird little corridors or dark tunnels for a long time waiting to get through.",
      "source": "evaluator"
